sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(245,183,61,0.18) Initiator
        participant C as Customer
    end
    box rgb(54,70,77,0.10) Telecom
        participant TT as Tata Tele
    end
    box rgb(31,38,80,0.08) talko-service :8003
        participant K as talko-service
    end
    box rgb(247,71,55,0.10) voiceai
        participant E as voiceai engine :5001
    end

    C->>TT: Dial AI DID
    TT->>K: WS start {direction: inbound}
    activate K
    K->>K: DID resolve (ai_agent)<br/>INBOUND_AGENT_MAP → agent_id
    K->>E: POST /ws-ticket (Bearer key)
    E-->>K: ticket
    K->>E: WS /chat/v1/agent?token= + forward start
    loop conversation
        C->>TT: speech
        TT->>K: media
        K->>E: media (+timestamp)
        E->>K: media (agent reply)
        K->>TT: media + mark
        E->>K: clear (barge-in)
        K->>TT: clear (flush buffer)
    end
    alt customer hangs up
        TT->>K: stop
        K->>E: forward stop + close
    else agent hangs up
        E->>K: WS close
        K->>TT: close leg (v1: media only)
    end
    Note over K: v1 limitation: agent hangup does<br/>not call Tata hangup API yet
    K->>K: CDR update
    deactivate K
